        "answer": "A) $-\\frac{x^2}{y^2}$"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "multiple-choice",
      "id": 7,
      "difficulty": "Hard",
      "prompt": "For $x^2+y^2=25$, the slope at $(3,-4)$ is:\nA) $-\\frac{3}{4}$\nB) $\\frac{3}{4}$\nC) $-\\frac{4}{3}$\nD) $\\frac{4}{3}$",
      "answer": "B) $\\frac{3}{4}$",
